				<div class="leadingarticles">
										
<div class="item ">
	<div class="item-bg">
	
			
				
			
			
				
		<p style="padding:0px 10px 0px 10px;">We live in an increasingly virtual world. Suppliers of consumer products still live very much in a physical world. More and more, retailers and consumers are asking suppliers to provide more and more flexible virtual data describing their physical product and inventories. <br /><br />Catalog Science, a spinoff company from Doba, is building technology to make this process of virtual inventory data aggregation, exchange, manipulation, flexibility, control, and publishing more streamlined. Look for our launch in 2010.</p>
<p style="padding:0px 10px 0px 10px;">In the meantime, if you'd like to be kept in the loop...</p>
<p style="padding:0px 10px 0px 10px;"><form method="post" id="userForm" enctype="multipart/form-data" action=""><table border="0" align="center">
